    "name": "Spatio-Agri Precision Fertilizer Manager API",
    "description": "Comprehensive Postman collection covering 100% of the Spatio-Agri Precision Fertilizer Management Backend API, including Health Checks, Authentication (with updated Pilot Service Area registration), Admin Analytics & KPIs with Redis Caching, Pilot Fleet Operations, Farmer Directories, Fields, Service Requests, Missions, and Financials.",
